<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Strayer rated outperformer.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Strayer rated outperformer.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said on Tuesday it initiated coverage of Strayer Education Inc with an outperformer rating on both an intermediate and long-term basis.</p>
<p>--Its price targets for the stock are $31 for the six months and $37 for the 18 months.</p>
<p>--EVEREN's earnings estimates for the college education provider are $1.30 for 1997 and $1.56 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Strayer was trading up 1-1/2 at 26-1/4.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
